### 1. Skapa kund Anna
POST http://localhost:8080/customers?name=Anna&phone=123456789

### 2. Skapa kund Erik (får inga fordon, testar LEFT JOIN)
POST http://localhost:8080/customers?name=Erik&phone=987654321

### 3. Hämta kund-ID via namn
GET http://localhost:8080/customer-id?name=Anna

### 4. Skapa fordon: Volvo
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles?registrationNumber=ABC123&brand=Volvo&model=V60&productionYear=2022

### 5. Skapa fordon: Saab
POST http://localhost:8080/vehicles?registrationNumber=XYZ789&brand=Saab&model=9-3&productionYear=2008

### 6. Koppla fordon 1 till kund 1
POST http://localhost:8080/addvehicletocustomer?customerId=1&vehicleId=1

### 7. Lista alla kunder med fordon
GET http://localhost:8080/customers

### 8. Lista alla fordon
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles

### 9. Lista fordon med bilmärket Volvo
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles-by-brand?brand=Volvo

### 10. Uppdatera bilmärke för fordon 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/vehicles/1/brand?brand=Saab

### 11. Lista registreringsnummer och bilmärke
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicle-brand-info

### 12. Kontrollera att märket ändrades
GET http://localhost:8080/vehicles